+/**
+ * @brief (Friday patch) Keep the voice prompt's DiT KV cache across streaming segments.
+ *
+ * Only takes effect while every diffusion step has a fixed DiT KV slot
+ * (`dit_kv_fixed_slots` == diffusion steps, no offloadable slots). The first streaming
+ * segment for a prompt runs the DiT once over the prompt alone (all steps) and keeps that
+ * KV prefix; every segment then starts as a continuation of it, so the prompt mel is not
+ * recomputed per segment. The prompt no longer attends to the first chunk of a segment
+ * (chunk-causal, as in upstream streaming). Switching prompts rebuilds the prefix.
+ */
